{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18417","headline":"宴杨驸马山亭 · 陈羽","name":"宴杨驸马山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂杨拂岸草茸茸，绣户窗前花影重。\n鱠下玉盘红缕细，酒开金瓮绿醅醲。\n中朝附马何平叔，南国词人陆士龙。\n落日泛舟同醉处，回潭百丈映千峯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}